OL,3,GNEWSAChurch can finally fix leaky roofs
OL,4,Athanks to grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Norman church where buckets had
OL,7,Fbecome a familiar sight to catch leaks
OL,8,Fand prevent water damage has received a
OL,9,Ffresh grant to help complete vital roof
OL,10,Frepairs.
OL,12,FHoly Rood Church in Shillingstone,
OL,13,FDorset, has spent the past three years
OL,14,Fraising more than #300,000 for
OL,15,Frestoration work.
OL,17,FAfter fixing two collapsed, leaking
OL,18,Fceilings, the congregation is now
OL,19,Faiming to finish the project by
OL,20,Frestoring the nave and porch roofs.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
