OL,3,GNEWSAChurch can finally fix leaky roofs
OL,4,Athanks to grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a recommendation from the
OL,7,FNational Churches Trust, Holy Rood has
OL,8,Fbeen awarded an #11,235 grant from the
OL,9,FWolfson Foundation to help fund the
OL,10,Ffinal phase of the work.
